    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0ad2484498797dc",
      "translationZh": "Google 今天发布了 Gemini 3.8 Live 和 3.8 Live Extended Thinking - 两个新的语音到语音模型，其形状与 OpenAI 的 GPT-Live 系列相似。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e346bb8ea28825ce",
      "translationZh": "我让 GPT-6 Astra Extra High 查看文档并让它为我构建了这个用于尝试新模型的网页 UI。您可以选择模型和语音预设，输入可选的系统提示，然后通过浏览器开始语音对话，包括在模型说话时打断它的能力。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9abebfe7a7807eb9",
      "translationZh": "该实现未使用任何库。它连接到 wss://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/ws/google.ai.generativelanguage.v1alpha.GenerativeService.BidiGenerateContent?key=... WebSocket 端点，并使用 Web Audio API AudioContext 进行捕获和播放。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a0ae6576ba2abff",
      "translationZh": "以下是 Gemini Live 教程，帮助您开始使用该 WebSockets API。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
